OL,4,CBall to celebrate historic brewers'    
OL,5,Chall revamp                            
OL,6,GAn Edwardian-themed ball will          
OL,7,Gcelebrate the revamp of a historic     
OL,8,Gbrewers' hall, with work to transform  
OL,9,Gthe venue starting next year.          
OL,11,FGrade II listed Yew Tree Hall in       
OL,12,FLorton, Cumbria, will get a new        
OL,13,Faccessible entrance with a platform    
OL,14,Flift after more than #120,000 of       
OL,15,Ffunding was secured.                   
OL,17,FChair of Trustees Adam Baker said it   
OL,18,Fwas hoped work would be completed by   
OL,19,Fnext summer, with a ball marking the   
OL,20,Ftransformation in a nod to the first   
OL,21,Fevent hosted there in 1909.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
