OL,4,CBingo caller reveals what it takes to  
OL,5,Cbe Britain's best                      
OL,6,GA bingo caller from Merseyside has won 
OL,7,Ga national title after 30 years in the 
OL,8,Gindustry.                              
OL,10,FAnton Fletcher, who works at Castle    
OL,11,FBingo in Bootle, was named National    
OL,12,FBingo Game Caller of the Year 2026 at  
OL,13,Fa competition in Leeds.                
OL,15,FThe former Butlin's Redcoat said       
OL,16,Fjudges praised him for getting players 
OL,17,Finvolved by walking through the hall   
OL,18,Fwhile calling numbers.                 
OL,20,FFletcher said his theatre background   
OL,21,Fhelped him project his voice and keep  
OL,22,Fplayers engaged.                  G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
