OL,4,C'Crucial' neurodiversity scheme could  
OL,5,Cbe expanded                            
OL,6,GA programme supporting children and    
OL,7,Gyoung people who are, or may be,       
OL,8,Gneurodivergent could be expanded after 
OL,9,Greceiving nearly 2,000 inquiries in    
OL,10,Gits first year.                        
OL,12,FCumberland Council's Neurodiversity    
OL,13,Fand Emotional Wellbeing Service offers 
OL,14,Fadvice, guidance and signposting, as   
OL,15,Fwell as an assessment to help identify 
OL,16,Fsupport which could be needed.         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
